  "name": "CHAOS Lab 4 · Radio Static (sample-and-hold FX)",
  "description": "Autoplay metallic crackles with no keyboard. The internal CHAOS sample-and-hold LFO (shape 2) steps the cutoff at 6.3 Hz while a clock drives short function-envelope strikes into twin VCAs; rough oscillators, stereo delay and reverb leave space around the pulses. The fixed clock and internal seeded LFO make this reproducible. Try LFO rate/depth/target, roughness, cutoff, function fall, delay mix. No external random source or phantom looper; real listening remains to be checked.",
